<title>INDIA: India's IDBI Bank opens branch in Coimbatore.</title>
<headline>India's IDBI Bank opens branch in Coimbatore.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The IDBI Bank Ltd inaugurated a branch at the south Indian city of Coimbatore on Friday taking its total number of branches to six, a bank statement said.</p>
<p>The bank is 80 percent owned by state-run term lending institution Industrial Development Bank of India, and the remaining 20 percent is held by its subsidiary Small Industries Development of India.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
